WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:09.390
It's like they wanna die. Too easy.

2
00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:12.890
Well. I'm loving every second
of this. so I say keep 'em coming!

3
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.320
I'm not sure which ones
are the true beasts here.

4
00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:22.110
Even missing an arm.
Chiyul's a beast himself.

5
00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.160
Okay. that's it for this group.

6
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.910
It's impressive how much
stronger you've gotten. Jinwoo.

7
00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.550
And that dagger's
also pretty striking.

8
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.380
Gotta say I'm really
impressed with you. too.

9
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:41.000
You fought. but didn't need me
to heal you even once.

10
00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:42.710
Yeah. guess I didn't. huh?

11
00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.680
Maybe we can get through this
without anybody needing my help.

12
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.100
Still. having you here is nice.

13
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.300
He's changed. and not just his looks.

14
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.550
There's a different aura about him.

15
00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:56.400
Like slaying beasts
is nothing to him now.

16
00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:59.150
Did you start learning martial arts?

17
00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:01.360
Let's keep it moving. people.

18
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.074
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org

19
00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:35.750
We've got a choice to make.

20
00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.830
The dungeon's been
easier than expected.

21
00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:40.160
Should be fine to split
into three groups.

22
00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:44.370
It'll up the risk factor if we do. but
we would clear this thing a lot sooner.

23
00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.170
The threat's low. so sure.

24
00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.050
I'll take the prisoners
down the path on the right.

25
00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:53.050
If you find the boss chamber.
send someone to let us know.

26
00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:57.180
Thanks to my enhanced
perception. it's obvious.

27
00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:59.560
The boss is down there.

28
00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.270
These goblins weren't
getting me much XP anyway.

29
00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.490
Mister Song. I say we
take the path on the left.

30
00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:07.900
Sounds good to me.

31
00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.740
You and I'll take the middle. then.

32
00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:11.530
Right. Let's go.

33
00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:14.530
Hmm.

34
00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:24.250
Won't have any problems
if it's just goblins.

35
00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:27.210
All I want is to clear
this thing in one piece.

36
00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.260
I'm sure we'll be fine.

37
00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:33.210
If the Weakest Hunter signed up for
this. how dangerous can it really be?

38
00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:38.060
Except. that's exactly what we
thought before. and well. you know...

39
00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.350
Speaking of...

40
00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.890
I've decided that
when this raid's over.

41
00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:46.450
I'm gonna apologize to Jinwoo.

42
00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.280
Hasn't it been bugging you?

43
00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.110
How we ran away.

44
00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.790
Not only are we pro hunters.
we're grown men.

45
00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:58.330
We ran for the sake of our
families. but he was one of our own.

46
00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.830
and we still left him there to die.

47
00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:03.240
It's about time
we swallowed our pride.

48
00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.430
True hunters wouldn't brush it off.

49
00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:09.750
Do you think he'll forgive us?

50
00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.920
No. not a chance.

51
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.770
But that's not gonna stop me.

52
00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.100
Come on. still got work to do.

53
00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.010
What a joke!
This isn't even a challenge.

54
00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.400
-That all of them?
-Shocked by how fast it was?

55
00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.110
I wanna make some more heads roll!

56
00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.770
-What if you were facing humans?
-What?

57
00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.570
Could you kill them as easily?

58
00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:38.120
A kill's a kill. I don't
see no difference.

59
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.120
Yeah. S'all the same shit.

60
00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:43.160
You wanted to talk.

61
00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.710
Three men. assaulted my daughter.

62
00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:52.590
She hanged herself because of it. and
my wife was hospitalized from the shock.

63
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:56.510
And yet somehow. the three of them
will be allowed to walk free in a few years.

64
00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.510
like nothing ever happened!

65
00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.850
To top it off. they're hunters!

66
00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:07.270
They can participate in raids while
they're detained and reduce their sentences!

67
00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.560
Tell me in what world is that fair?

68
00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.940
Where they roam free. but my
daughter never comes home!

69
00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.450
What's this?

70
00:05:16.530 --> 00:05:18.780
Three billion. right here.

71
00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.200
I'll beg you.

72
00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:24.540
If that's what it takes.
Just please kill them!

73
00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.130
No one has to know.

74
00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:30.080
What happens in a dungeon
stays in the dungeon!

75
00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.460
So. please...!

76
00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:33.760
Please do this for me!

77
00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:40.090
Here's what I'll say when
I talk with the inspectors.

78
00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:46.030
A hundred goblins appeared. and killed
all three of you in a very brutal fashion.

79
00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:51.190
This path is winding around so much it feels
like we might just be going in circles.

80
00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:53.560
Could be. we got the dud cave.

81
00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:55.200
But. oh. well.

82
00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:59.490
Somebody help me!

83
00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:01.820
Were you hoping for a quick death?

84
00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.160
Well. no such luck. 'cause I was
asked to make you suffer first.

85
00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.960
as much as I could.

86
00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.920
W-What the hell's going on here?

87
00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.920
Ah. Seems the paths are connected.

88
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.550
So if you're here. I guess that would
mean the left path led to the boss' lair.

89
00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:20.600
-Thanks for the directions.
-Please! You gotta sa--

90
00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.600
Slight change of plans.
but it's fine.

91
00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:34.070
That Taeshik Kang guy visited me
in the hospital with his superior.

92
00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:37.740
Hopefully. he won't
remember me. though.

93
00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.190
-C'mon!
-Right!

94
00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.460
What the hell were
they attacked by...

95
00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.710
Jeongho!

96
00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.680
What happened here?

97
00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.510
Huh?

98
00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:12.140
Mister Kim.

99
00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.270
Joohee. heal him.

100
00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:17.240
Hurry and do it!

101
00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.200
Huh! O-Okay!

102
00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:24.150
Mister Kim! Please hang on!

103
00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:27.290
His wounds weren't made
by a magic beast.

104
00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:30.000
Those cuts are too clean.
and several look like

105
00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.580
killing strokes pulled
at the last second.

106
00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:37.510
Stop it. Joohee.
I'm not gonna make it.

107
00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.380
What are you talking about?

108
00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.420
You have a family that needs you.

109
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:45.640
Dying isn't an option. So no.

110
00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.890
You can't just die now.
I won't allow it. you're gonna live.

111
00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:51.810
How can I keep blaming you
if you don't?

112
00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:55.490
I'm so sorry.
I wish I had more than words.

113
00:07:56.480 --> 00:08:00.650
Saw this playing out
much differently in my head.

114
00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:04.110
I was gonna give you
a proper apology.

115
00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:08.450
But know I am sorry. kid.

116
00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:11.370
I really mean it.

117
00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.340
Goodbye. Sangshik.

118
00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.890
Whoa. you're a fast one.

119
00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:38.450
Thought I'd save myself some
trouble by taking out the healer first.

120
00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:42.190
But it seems you managed
to delay the inevitable.

121
00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.990
Mister Kang?
Are you behind this?

122
00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.450
It's possible.

123
00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:49.620
But why? You're from the Association!

124
00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:53.780
-You won't get away with murder!
-I might with the perfect story.

125
00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:57.920
I was gonna say that a horde of
goblins was to blame for this little mess.

126
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.290
but how about this new angle?

127
00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:04.540
The prisoners were plotting an escape
from the start. They killed you all!

128
00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:09.470
And then they made the mistake of ambushing
me while I was busy fighting the boss.

129
00:09:09.550 --> 00:09:12.430
But they soon found out
they were sorely outmatched.

130
00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.760
and that's why
I was the sole survivor.

131
00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.860
Well. guys? Think they'll buy it?

132
00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.110
You piece of trash.

133
00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:22.690
Though you've improved.
you won't win. I'll have to fight.

134
00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.910
I'm borrowing this. Sangshik.

135
00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:29.280
Been a while since I raised
a sword against a man.

136
00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:32.450
He's one rank above me. but still!

137
00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.250
Joohee. could you cast
a physical strength buff on me?

138
00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.250
Uh. yes!

139
00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:41.420
Assassin types
tend to have weak defenses.

140
00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.250
I'll exploit his.

141
00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.640
A washed-up mage like you is
suddenly relying on strength instead?

142
00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.430
This is bound to go well.

143
00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.770
I'm a swordsman right now.
I'll show you.

144
00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:57.690
Your hunter abilities are magic-focused.
so that sword won't do you much good!

145
00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.690
Hu-hah!

146
00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:03.230
This has-been's still
full of surprises!

147
00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.410
Look who's got moves. Wow.

148
00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.360
And it's not even the buff
that's doing it.

149
00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.700
You've refined those skills!

150
00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:12.700
For a split second. Mister
Song caught up to him.

151
00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.210
If he was a little faster.

152
00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:19.920
As quick as you are precise. I can see
why you ditched your magic for the sword

153
00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:23.210
Even so. you have your limitations.

154
00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.430
That pain-in-the-ass healer.

155
00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:31.350
She dies first after all.

156
00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.520
You really turned your back
on an armed opponent?

157
00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.850
You're certainly not an average
old fart. I'll give you that much.

158
00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.940
I train an S-Rank hunter with a blade!

159
00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.360
I won't be beaten by yours!

160
00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:51.490
It's true you're skilled. but those
pesky limitations still stunt you.

161
00:10:51.570 --> 00:10:53.950
Did you honestly think
that a mage with a sword

162
00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:57.040
and strength buff could
beat an assassin hunter?

163
00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:03.040
Here. I've got you!

164
00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.090
No!

165
00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.970
Fitting that your healer
is useless. too.

166
00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.180
Later. pops.

167
00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.310
Did it work?

168
00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:27.360
You took up that sword to make
me lower my guard against magic.

169
00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:31.030
All so you could blast me
when I went for the kill.

170
00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:33.530
Slick for a senile old bastard.

171
00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.330
Just not slick enough.

172
00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:37.130
I'm finished!

173
00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:39.280
Now die.

174
00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:48.920
Again? Who are you?

175
00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.050
Jinwoo Sung.

176
00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:52.840
E-Rank Hunter.

177
00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.860
E-Rank?

178
00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:57.060
You think I'm stupid?

179
00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:58.890
Jinwoo. the way you moved.

180
00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:00.430
Where'd that come from?

181
00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:05.360
I could see a power type being
able to block that. even at E-Rank.

182
00:12:05.440 --> 00:12:07.070
But your reaction time is insane

183
00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.530
and to pull it off twice
you'd need an assassin build.

184
00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:12.440
You're build isn't
what matters. though.

185
00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.330
Because you've been
hiding your skills.

186
00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:17.580
Your little group seems
to know each other.

187
00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:22.330
That rules out you being a false
ranker. they don't let witnesses live.

188
00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.840
Which. of course.
can only mean one thing.

189
00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:28.460
-A second awakening.
-Is that really true?

190
00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:30.380
He reawakened?

191
00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:34.050
So then. it must've happened
after the double dungeon!

192
00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.220
Double dungeon?

193
00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:39.310
Wait. Is he that pathetic E-Rank?

194
00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:42.310
But he looks and acts like
a different person now.

195
00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:46.070
And the mana meter only read
ten when we tested him again.

196
00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:49.230
If he reawakened. it was afterwards.

197
00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.940
So how'd he survive
the double dungeon?

198
00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.650
In any case...

199
00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:56.660
it's clear you're still
lacking experience.

200
00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:59.830
Allow me to give you
a master class in hunting.

201
00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.990
I would prefer an explanation.

202
00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.030
You mean for killing the convicts?

203
00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:07.590
They assaulted someone
and it drove her to suicide.

204
00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:09.880
The grieving father
asked me to avenge her.

205
00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:13.290
They weren't adequately punished.
so it's a bit of social justice.

206
00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.800
No. it's not the criminals
I'm asking about.

207
00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:18.430
Why kill Mister Kang and Mister Kim?

208
00:13:18.510 --> 00:13:22.260
If it was to silence them. you
didn't have to resort to torture.

209
00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.800
But that's exactly what you did.

210
00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.060
You toyed with them.

211
00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:30.020
"Bit of social justice?" Yeah. right.

212
00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.280
That's not what motivates you.

213
00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:38.410
Sure. I can take out
three criminals. easy.

214
00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:41.200
But you've got the
wrong idea. I'm afraid.

215
00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:46.080
Thing is. B-Ranks like me.
we're. uh. "top shelf." if you will.

216
00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:50.980
So why do I work for jack at the Association
when plenty of major guilds want me?

217
00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:54.080
I'll tell you. I enjoy killing.

218
00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.770
And it's far more fun killing
people than it is killing beasts!

219
00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:03.950
A reawakened E-Rank
has his limits. too!

220
00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:06.770
Too slow.

221
00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:08.480
Impressive.

222
00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.520
Look at that agility!

223
00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:16.200
He's nothing like the Jinwoo
I remember!

224
00:14:16.280 --> 00:14:18.040
Nothing at all!

225
00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:22.570
-He's as fast as me!
-He's as fast as me!

226
00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.960
We've got the same build.
and similar skill levels.

227
00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.330
but I have more experience
battling high-ranked enemies.

228
00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:32.210
And that's why you're going
to lose this fight!

229
00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:42.050
Well. you do have some grit.

230
00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:44.050
Sorry.

231
00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.410
But think you could be
a little less bloodthirsty?

232
00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:51.190
See? Even the system's noticed now.

233
00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:52.440
Huh?

234
00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.060
Actually. I should be grateful.

235
00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:58.740
The system's given me another
reason to make sure you die.

236
00:14:58.820 --> 00:15:00.320
The system?

237
00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:02.030
What's he mean?

238
00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.620
I'm the one who has
the advantage here.

239
00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.660
He got even faster! Wait!

240
00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:17.050
His dagger can inflict poison?

241
00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:24.140
You wanna see something real special?

242
00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.480
He vanished!

243
00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.430
I should be undetectable.
you perceptive bastard.

244
00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:36.610
This is the Stealth skill. It hides
 my form. sounds. and scent.

245
00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:40.740
Only a select few assassin
hunters can even use this ability.

246
00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:43.530
Of course. no one knows
I'm one of them.

247
00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:47.080
Any guesses why? Go on!

248
00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:53.920
People have seen me use it. but none
of them have ever lived to tell the tale.

249
00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.210
How's that tendon. by the way?

250
00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:59.630
-I'll heal you. Jinwoo!
-Keep your hands to yourself!

251
00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.710
Be patient and wait
your turn. you're next.

252
00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.340
Jinwoo's bound to be exhausted!

253
00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:08.520
Think you can dodge my
next strike with that injured leg?

254
00:16:08.600 --> 00:16:10.310
-'Cause I don't.
-Hey.

255
00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.180
Are you done talking now?

256
00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:14.020
Full recovery.

257
00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.150
No.

258
00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:18.230
He healed in an instant!

259
00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:22.440
I've never heard of a combat hunter
who could use healing magic. too.

260
00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.480
What else can he do?

261
00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.080
I can't read him.

262
00:16:26.160 --> 00:16:27.990
I just know he's dangerous!

263
00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.990
That's another of my emotions gone.

264
00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.750
I don't even need to get
angry to kill filth like you.

265
00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:40.340
I get it now. You've also killed
people before. haven't you?

266
00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:44.500
So we're in the same biz!

267
00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.060
I see.

268
00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:50.890
He must've had to make a number
of grave decisions in a very short time.

269
00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:53.850
And it changed more than
just his appearance.

270
00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:59.110
Awakenings. They granted humans unthinkable
power and turned the world on its head.

271
00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:01.520
Laws and ethics
don't mean shit in here.

272
00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:03.730
We hunters make the rules.

273
00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:06.580
Therefore. the strongest
come out on top.

274
00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:13.160
Hang on!

275
00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.670
Is he tracking me from my bloodlust?

276
00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:19.130
But he still can't pinpoint
me exactly!

277
00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.840
This power!

278
00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:30.060
No. It can't be!

279
00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:36.580
Wait. What the hell?

280
00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.610
You asked why
I killed those other two.

281
00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:48.790
The answer's pretty simple.

282
00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:53.450
We thrive in combat.
so normal morals don't apply.

283
00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:55.340
And you're just the same.

284
00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.000
Goes for all hunters.

285
00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:59.750
Basically. we're
killing machines. right?

286
00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.920
So I'll die.
'Cause it's natural selection.

287
00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:06.300
The strongest one makes
the rules and I lost to you.

288
00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.640
But what the hell are you?

289
00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.930
An assassin class
with healing and debuff magic.

290
00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.890
It's unheard of.

291
00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:18.400
It is. Actually. I also wanna
know what the hell I am.

292
00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.520
I know whatever you are.
it's not an E-Rank.

293
00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:28.280
and after killing me. your little
charade is over. so why not come clean?

294
00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:29.700
All right. then.

295
00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:33.040
I am a hunter who gets stronger
with every battle.

296
00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:39.920
Then your shadow must stretch
into some really nasty places.

297
00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:45.040
Oh. you'll probably get as
strong as those places are dark.

298
00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:48.180
I suggest you watch it. though.

299
00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.680
If you gaze for long into an abyss.

300
00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:55.140
the abyss. gazes also into you.

301
00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.270
He's right.

302
00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:08.570
The strength I have now is incomparable
to my old self. and for some reason...

303
00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:14.200
the stronger I get. the more I feel
something inside of me falling apart.

304
00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.870
Thank you!

305
00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.660
You saved us again!

306
00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:19.410
I'm just so blown away.

307
00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:22.250
Survived another near-death
experience thanks to you.

308
00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:26.380
Yeah. well. go on ahead and
start making your way out of here.

309
00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:27.840
I'll handle the boss.

310
00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.880
What? All by yourself?

311
00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.220
On second thought. you do that.

312
00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:37.140
It's a shame we can't give Sangshik
and Jeongho proper burials. though.

313
00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:39.110
We'll wait for you outside.

314
00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:51.900
Manager Woo!

315
00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:54.110
I heard the report.
Where are they?

316
00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:55.700
Right this way.

317
00:19:55.780 --> 00:20:00.710
I can't believe Taeshik Kang was covertly
going on killing sprees all this time.

318
00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.950
He always struck me
as a little sketchy.

319
00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:07.140
but as his supervisor.
I was too careless.

320
00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.420
These are the survivors.

321
00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.340
That one.

322
00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:13.840
He's the E-Rank hunter from before.

323
00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.180
He hit quite a growth spurt.

324
00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:18.430
-Huh?
-Good to see you again.

325
00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:20.640
You're inspector. um...

326
00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.970
Jinchul Woo.

327
00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:25.520
You'll receive a formal apology
for what Taeshik put you through.

328
00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.690
But. first things first...

329
00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.820
let's address the main issue.

330
00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:33.030
Which of you actually defeated him?

331
00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:36.990
Guess I really can't keep
my secret any longer.

332
00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:42.160
Which means. I'm gonna have to call
up Jinho and cancel our arrangement.

333
00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.870
It was me.

334
00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.340
I'm the one responsible
for killing Taeshik Kang.

335
00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:48.880
Then. would you kindly
remind me what rank you are?

336
00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:50.590
C-Rank. sir.

337
00:20:50.670 --> 00:20:53.750
And could you explain.
how you achieved your victory?

338
00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.850
Why. with my healer's help. right?

339
00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:57.560
Um...

340
00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:58.930
Ah. I see.

341
00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:02.680
Her buffs must've been pretty
powerful to give you an edge.

342
00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.220
Taeshik was one
of the strongest B-Ranks.

343
00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:09.320
By all accounts. a C-Rank mage
shouldn't have stood a chance.

344
00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.860
Very well.

345
00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:15.610
I'll need to write this incident up.
so if you could please come with me.

346
00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:20.330
Can't get cocky just
because I beat that maniac.

347
00:21:20.410 --> 00:21:24.160
I couldn't tell before.
but this guy is an A-Rank.

348
00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.790
As I am. I'd be helpless against him.

349
00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:31.340
Sorry if I overstepped
my bounds by doing that.

350
00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:33.210
I imagine you've got
a pretty good reason

351
00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.670
for keeping your true
strength hidden. though.

352
00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:41.890
Well. I owe you my life. so let's
just call this payback. shall we?

353
00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:49.110
Three hours later. the man who
hired Taeshik Kang to kill the prisoners

354
00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:53.570
turned himself in. which confirmed
that we acted in self-defense.

355
00:21:56.070 --> 00:21:57.740
What a day. huh?

356
00:21:57.820 --> 00:21:59.580
-Jinwoo.
-Huh?

357
00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:02.620
We had a deal.

358
00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.500
You remember it. right?

359
